to-be-incorporated-into-paper-122 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-122 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Paths are equality.** `a ≡ b` is the type of paths between `a` and `b` (in a type found from" (cons "them; `Path A a b` names the type), `a ≡[ i ↦ A ] b` a path over a line of types. A path is" (cons "`λ i → e`, applied as `p i`; the interval has `0`, `1`, `~ r`, `r ∧ s`, `r ∨ s`. A partial value is" (cons "`[ i = 0 ↦ a , i = 1 ↦ b ]`, composition `comp (λ i → A) (λ j → [ ... ]) a0`, transport" (cons "`transp (λ i → A) a`. Whether a λ or an application is a path's or a function's is decided by the" (cons "checker (as “Elaboration” in “The language as implemented” describes it), so it is written the same way. `lib/std.cub` has `refl`, `sym`, `_∙_`, `cong`," (cons "`subst`, `transport`, `funExt`, equivalences and `ua`, with `calc` chains:" (cons "`calc a ≡ b by p ≡ c by q` (each step on its own indented line if long), composed by `_∙_`." nil))))))))
